%% Title: State · retention lifecycle of a stored post
%% Summary: What becomes of a post over time: live Reddit text blanked at 48 hours or on upstream deletion, demo posts purged at the retention boundary, and real posts meant to be compacted into monthly rollups, which on master rolls back at the content-nulling step, with what is kept at each step.
%% Sources: src/collectors/retention.js, src/collectors/reddit/{maintenance,recheck}.js, scripts/compact.js (purgeDemoPosts, compactMonth), src/db/migrations/001 (content NOT NULL), 005, 025. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md section 19 (three-tier model); ADR 0001 ruling 9.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  [*] --> detail : stored (raw_posts, scores, audit rows, embedding when relevance ≥ 1/20)

  state "Tier 1 · full detail<br/>shown on the page for its trailing hour,<br/>receipt available" as detail
  state "Reddit text blanked<br/>content = removal notice,<br/>text_removed_at set;<br/>scores, audit rows, hash,<br/>fingerprint and embedding kept" as blanked
  state "demo post purged<br/>post and every dependent row deleted<br/>(scores, audit, embedding, sightings)" as purged
  state "Tier 2 · compacted month (target, not reachable on master)<br/>monthly_topic_rollups + monthly_source_rollups,<br/>embeddings deleted, audit rows kept" as compacted
  state "content nulling blocked<br/>raw_posts.content is NOT NULL,<br/>so a real month cannot finish compacting" as blocked_null
  state "scheduled compaction and<br/>per-source retention windows" as wip_sched

  detail --> blanked : Reddit only, 48 h after collection (worker, every 5 min)
  detail --> blanked : Reddit only, re-check finds it deleted or removed (every 6 h)
  detail --> purged : demo feed only, older than RETENTION_DETAIL_DAYS (90) at npm run compact
  detail --> blocked_null : real post, its month holds a post older than 90 days, npm run compact
  blocked_null --> detail : step 5 (null raw_posts.content) fails, the month's transaction rolls back rollups and embedding deletes
  blanked --> blocked_null : its month holds a post older than 90 days (same rollback)
  blocked_null --> compacted : once raw_posts.content may be NULL (not on master)
  detail --> wip_sched
  purged --> [*]

  note right of blanked
    one data_retention_log row per batch,
    action blanked_platform_terms
    (owner decision: blank text, keep audit rows)
  end note
  note right of purged
    data_retention_log action purged_demo,
    demo posts never enter a rollup
  end note

  note right of wip_sched
    legend: green = done, on master or ships in this PR;
    dashed amber = wip, PR #10 Part 2;
    dotted red = gap, not reachable on master
  end note

  classDef done fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b3d1f
  classDef wip fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#b7791f,color:#5c3d00,stroke-dasharray:5 3
  class detail, blanked, purged, blocked_null done
  classDef gap fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b3261e,color:#5c1a14,stroke-dasharray:2 3
  class compacted gap
  class wip_sched wip
